  "html": "\n<div align=\"center\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"630\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td height=\"10\" width=\"630\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/memo_t.gif\" height=\"25\" width=\"630\"><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<img border=\"0\" height=\"17\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/tips_logo.gif\" width=\"200\"></span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/memo_m.gif\" height=\"39\" width=\"630\"> <p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"1\" bordercolordark=\"#666666\" bordercolorlight=\"black\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"600\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/alpha_background.gif\" height=\"30\" width=\"594\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;<b><img align=\"absbottom\" border=\"0\" height=\"30\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/h.gif\" width=\"30\">EARTWOOD(허트우드)</b></span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td height=\"223\" width=\"594\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:50%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\">&nbsp;<img align=\"left\" border=\"1\" data-original-src=\"http://www.forg.co.kr/dungeon/image/dungeon/ML/Heartwood.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"200\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing-slot.svg\" style=\"aspect-ratio:200/200\" width=\"200\"></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font color=\"maroon\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b>마을설명 \n                                        :</b></span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">브리타니아대륙의 \n                            YEW(유)마을을 은행에서 남쪽으로 진행하시면</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">유마을 \n                            중앙에 허트우드로 워프하실 수 있는 게이트를 만나실 \n                            수</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">있게 \n                            됩니다.</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">허트우드마을에서는 \n                            엘프족 NPC가 상주해 있으며 물건을 판매하는</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">상인은 \n                            없고, 대부분이 퀘스트와 연관되어 있는 NPC들입니다.</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">던전, \n                            필드에서 퀘스트를 받는다면 한번씩은 필연적으로 들어가셔야 \n                            하는 마을이라고 생각하시면 됩니다.</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">----------------------------------------------------</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"11\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/icon_1.gif\" width=\"11\"><img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"11\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/icon_2.gif\" width=\"11\"><img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"11\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/icon_3.gif\" width=\"11\"> \n                                        : 주의할만한 장소</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"9\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/icon_4.gif\" width=\"13\"> \n                                        : 비밀문이나 잠김문</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"11\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/icon_5.gif\" width=\"11\"> \n                                        : 던전내 중요 지점</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">----------------------------------------------------</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/l_line.gif\" width=\"30\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://www.forg.co.kr/dungeon/image/r_line.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing-slot.svg\" style=\"aspect-ratio:30/16\" width=\"30\"></span></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img border=\"1\" height=\"240\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/dungeon/ML/Heartwood_map.gif\" width=\"240\"></span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:40; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:40;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"11\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/icon_2.gif\" width=\"11\"> \n                            : 워프포인트</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:40; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:40;\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">A지역 \n                            : Expeditionist(탐사), Tradition(관습학자)</font></span></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:40; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:40;\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">B지역 \n                            : The Wine Tender(와인숙성자), The Grape Tender(포도숙성자), \n                            Weaver(직공)</font></span></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:40; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:40;\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">C지역 \n                            : Cloth Weaver(테일러)</font></span></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:40; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:40;\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">D지역 \n                            : Wise(현인), Bowcraft(활쟁이), Tradition(관습학자)</font></span></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:40; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:40;\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">E지역 \n                            : Metal&nbsp;Weaver(대장장이)</font></span></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:40; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:40;\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">F지역 \n                            : Soil nurturer(토양학자), Healer(힐러), Thaumaturgist(요술사), \n                            Guard(경비병)</font></span></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:40; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:40;\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">G지역 \n                            : Arcanist(아케인니스트)</font></span></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:40; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:40;\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">H지역 \n                            : Tradition(관습학자)</font></span></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:50%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><b>&lt;&lt;&lt;&nbsp;</b></font></span><a href=\"/site/dungeon/monster/\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"#000066\" face=\"Verdana\"><b>Dungeon \